## What Is an Image Collage Maker?

An Image Collage Maker is an online tool that lets you combine multiple photos into one image. Instead of keeping several pictures separately, you can arrange them together in a single collage.

You can use a collage for social media posts, photo collections, travel memories, product images, project presentations, or personal photo albums.

## How to Make a Photo Collage

Creating a collage is simple and does not require advanced photo-editing software.

### Step 1: Open the Image Collage Maker

Open the Image Collage Maker tool and select the photos you want to combine.

### Step 2: Add Your Images

Upload multiple images from your device. You can select photos from your computer, phone, or tablet.

### Step 3: Choose a Layout

Select a suitable layout for your photos. Depending on the number of images, you can use a simple grid or another available arrangement.

### Step 4: Arrange Your Photos

Move or reposition your photos within the collage so that the important parts of each image are visible.

### Step 5: Adjust Spacing and Borders

Change the spacing between images if the tool provides these options. You can also adjust borders or other available settings to give the collage a cleaner appearance.

### Step 6: Create and Download

When your collage looks the way you want, generate the final image and download it to your device.

