## Tips for Creating a Better Photo Collage

### Choose Related Images

Use photos that have a common theme, event, person, product, or location. This makes the final collage easier to understand.

### Keep the Layout Simple

Avoid unnecessarily complicated layouts when a simple grid can display your images clearly.

### Use Similar Image Sizes

Images with similar proportions can make the collage look more balanced.

### Leave Enough Spacing

A small amount of space between images can make each photo easier to distinguish.

### Check the Final Image

Before downloading, check that important parts of your photos are not cropped or hidden.

